{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受缺少X那种细密的层次和分时呈现，尤其是情绪转折、旋律起伏和声音质感的对应不如X具体。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的优势是叙事清楚，普通观众不需要反复拼接话语，就能理解人物每一步为什么产生这样的反应，也容易跟住从试探、暴露、放松到不安、接受的完整变化。X的加亮重点和分时感受确实更有音乐伴随感，细节也更丰富，但部分感受词连续堆叠、意象频繁转换，容易让人忙于阅读而顾不上听音乐。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，但X的细腻音乐表达值得保留。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0c74cc6a-6e58-4106-afe8-f4a14e3438bd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022057332157Z", "elapsed_seconds": 65.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:22:02.369600+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "52d624f76df5beaa5c31bc86aa7f7422e8b5fb931928735c846ac3fe119840df", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa